{"jobs": [{"absolute_url": "https://careers.duolingo.com/jobs/8625579002?gh_jid=8625579002", "data_compliance": [{"type": "gdpr", "requires_consent": false, "requires_processing_consent": false, "requires_retention_consent": false, "retention_period": null, "demographic_data_consent_applies": false}], "internal_job_id": 6444869002, "location": {"name": "Tokyo, Japan"}, "metadata": [{"id": 10945305002, "name": "Division", "value": "Marketing and Communications", "value_type": "single_select"}, {"id": 9700632002, "name": "Req Type", "value": "Industry", "value_type": "single_select"}, {"id": 98443292002, "name": "Featured Title", "value": null, "value_type": "short_text"}, {"id": 98445720002, "name": "Featured City Name", "value": null, "value_type": "single_select"}], "id": 8625579002, "updated_at": "2026-07-29T09:16:34-04:00", "requisition_id": "R-01174", "title": "Consumer Product Lead", "company_name": "Duolingo", "first_published": "2026-07-08T20:07:38-04:00", "language": "en", "application_deadline": null, "content": "&lt;p&gt;Our mission at Duolingo is to develop the best education in the world and make it universally available. It’s a big mission, and that’s where you come in!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Duolingo, you’ll join a team that cares about educating our users, experimenting with big ideas, making fact-based decisions, and finding innovative solutions to complex problems. You’ll have limitless learning opportunities and daily collaborations with world-class minds — while doing work that’s both meaningful and fun.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join our life-changing mission to develop education for our half a billion (and growing!) learners around the world.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Z7ph2&quot;&gt;Read &lt;a href=&quot;https://blog.duolingo.com/?utm_source=greenhouse.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;amp;utm_campaign=generalblog_gh_091224&quot;&gt;our blog&lt;/a&gt; to learn more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Consumer Product Lead (Merchandise / Online Store Lead) to grow Duolingo&#39;s online store in Japan and build it into a meaningful part of how fans experience our brand. This role is a backfill for the previous head of merch and will focus primarily on the Duolingo Store, while also helping shape pop-ups and potential retail store opportunities. You&#39;ll lead merchandising and ecommerce for Japan, with a high bar for quality, localization, and brand fit, while helping Duolingo show up in the real world in ways that feel uniquely delightful and culturally resonant.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Japan is one of Duolingo&#39;s most important brand and IP markets, and this role has a real opportunity to build something from the ground up, with the potential for successful playbooks, formats, and learnings from Japan to inform how we scale merchandising globally over time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role reports to the Director of Country Marketing, Japan &amp;amp; Korea.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🧠&amp;nbsp; You will...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the P&amp;amp;L and day-to-day operations of Duolingo&#39;s online store in Japan, including demand forecasting, inventory planning, assortment planning, site performance, supply chain, and fulfillment, with a high bar for efficiency and quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the store as a startup within Japan&#39;s marketing org, growing it with an eye toward revenue, ROI, and commercial performance across traffic, conversion, AOV, repeat purchase, and sell-through&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead product planning, design direction, and production, from concept through launch, in partnership with Brand, Design, Social, and Operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, select, and manage external partners (vendors, manufacturers, agencies) and own those stakeholder relationships end-to-end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the Duolingo Store into an efficient, on-brand marketing channel that deepens fan engagement through product drops, storytelling, and localized execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute pop-up experiences and help explore future retail store opportunities that bring Duolingo to life in Japan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and test merchandising concepts, product drops, and launch formats in Japan first, developing repeatable systems and playbooks so that what works can be adopted by other markets as we scale our consumer products business globally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the broader marketing team to connect store moments with campaigns, community buzz, and brand storytelling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✅&amp;nbsp; You have...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years in e-commerce, merchandising, or consumer products leadership for a consumer-facing brand&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building a merchandising or e-commerce function from 0 to 1, with hands-on ownership of a P&amp;amp;L and platforms such as Shopify&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An ability to think outside the box on merchandising and branding, balancing commercial performance with strong brand fit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading cross-functional work across creative, marketing, operations, and external partners, with excellent execution skills in fast-moving environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business-level English and Japanese, with strong communication skills across local and global teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;⭐&amp;nbsp; Exceptional candidates will have...&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience launching or operating pop-ups, experiential retail, or store-based brand activations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience scaling a merchandising or ecommerce function internationally, especially with localized assortments or market-specific launches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with fandom-driven, character-led, or lifestyle brands where products help consumers express identity and affinity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong instincts for what makes physical products feel uniquely Duolingo: high quality, distinctive, and culturally resonant&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An entrepreneurial mindset and comfort owning a business end-to-end, with an eye toward turning a Japan success story into a broader, potentially global, merchandising mode&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The offered salary is dependent upon several factors, including work experience, skills, and internal peer comparisons. The posted range is subject to change in the future. For this role, base salary is supplemented by equity compensation. We encourage you to talk with your recruiter for more information related to compensation for this role!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Salary Range: &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;¥17,178,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;¥25,767,100 JPY&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;Z7ph2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt; Take a peek at how we care for our employees&#39; holistic well-being with our benefits &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.duolingo.com/#benefits&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Alerts:&lt;/strong&gt; Sign up for job alerts &lt;a href=&quot;http://my.greenhouse.io/users/sign_in?job_board=duolingo&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accommodations: &lt;/strong&gt;We will do everything we can within reason to make sure that your interview takes place in an environment that fairly and accurately assesses your skills. If you need assistance or accommodation, please contact &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:accommodations@duolingo.com&quot;&gt;accommodations@duolingo.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Employment Opportunity: &lt;/strong&gt;Duolingo is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, gender (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, or other applicable legally protected characteristics.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fraud Warning: &lt;/strong&gt;Unfortunately, there is a rise in scammers pretending to be real Duolingo employees. Duolingo and our employees will never ask for your Social Security number, bank details, or passport info, and we’ll never ask you to deposit a check, purchase equipment, or exchange money during the interview process. Real Duolingo employees always use an email that ends in @duolingo.com or @recruiting.duolingo.com. Stay alert and double-check these details before sharing any information.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;By applying for this position your data will be processed as per the&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vTX9GKeRMOMA9Vtm0vfGibrYPYz8ysl0Dg8KSXgj_PxeT5ChsdnNZZWtpxu4t7xillTPGnngnKCjIbV/pub&quot;&gt; Duolingo Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;", "departments": [{"id": 4034087002, "name": "Marketing and Communications", "child_ids": [4034820002], "parent_id": null}], "offices": [{"id": 4039388002, "name": "Remote", "location": "Remote", "child_ids": [], "parent_id": null}], "ai_disclaimer": "<p><strong style="font-size: 14px;">AI in Hiring: </strong><span style="font-size: 14px;">Duolingo uses AI technology to assist in our hiring process. We want to be transparent about how we use this technology and your rights. We use Greenhouse Software's Talent Matching feature to assist with reviewing applications for the skills and experience we have decided are important for this role.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style="font-size: 14px;">How it works:</strong><span style="font-size: 14px;"> </span></p><ol><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui"></span>Talent Matching reviews your resume and responses to application questions to determine the extent to which your qualifications match the job requirements selected for this role. These requirements and their desired weighting are established by our recruiters in collaboration with hiring managers.</li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui"></span>All Talent Matching output is reviewed by our recruiting and hiring teams, who make the final decision on each application. Talent Matching does not automatically disposition any candidate or make hiring decisions.</li></ol>", "include_ai_disclaimer": true, "ai_opt_out_request_url": "http://app2.greenhouse.io/ai_opt_out_request/job_post/8625579002/ai_opt_out"}]}
